#
# The 2026 Form IN-114 instructions (Rev. 10/25): who must pay, the 90% and
# 100% options and the $500 threshold, the due dates, and annualising. The
# Department's site refuses automated downloads, so the copy hashed is the
# Internet Archive's capture of the published URL, of 2026-02-03. The anchors
# are the instructions' headings; no page is given.

